 {:seon.task/name "the-scratch-stores-proof-has-a-mutation"
  :seon.task/plan "Found 2026-11-10 by a slow-test helper (group B): seon.proofs-test/a-process-plans-on-more-scratch-stores-than-its-undo-entries (now 11 stores, one past the 10 undo entries) went red under no mutation tried: the LMDB fork has held no semaphore since 7b7de38f, so what it guards may be gone. Find the mutation that breaks the claim (a store opened without its semaphore release) or show the claim is the fork's now and move the proof there."
